1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,344
Last piece... got it!

2
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:10,766
You let go!

3
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:18,763
This morning, Milo and Pip had a big idea.

4
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:25,472
Let's build a windmill! One that really spins!

5
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:31,619
Okay! I'll hold, you build.

6
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:45,425
Um... Pip? I'm stuck.

7
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:52,876
Ta-da! Now you have a paper hat!

8
00:00:57,350 --> 00:00:59,789
Look, Pip. We made this. Together!

9
00:01:05,350 --> 00:01:07,697
Just one more blade to go.

10
00:01:10,350 --> 00:01:12,441
And then... the wind came.

11
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:17,917
Milo, I didn't let go. See?

12
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:23,636
But it's broken! It's ruined!

13
00:01:27,350 --> 00:01:29,553
We can fix it. Slowly...

14
00:01:29,903 --> 00:01:31,984
No! I'll fix it! Fast!

15
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:04,980
Grrr! I don't like this windmill anymore!

16
00:02:08,350 --> 00:02:13,705
Milo felt hot and tight inside. That feeling is frustration.

17
00:02:22,350 --> 00:02:25,330
Milo? Pause. Breathe. Tell me.

18
00:02:30,350 --> 00:02:33,031
I can't. My tummy is too windy.

19
00:02:37,350 --> 00:02:39,380
Okay. I'll be right here.

20
00:02:52,350 --> 00:02:56,681
Milo saw Pip's droopy ears. Pip felt sad too.

21
00:03:06,350 --> 00:03:08,830
Pause. Breathe. Tell me.

22
00:03:22,350 --> 00:03:24,782
What could Milo say to Pip?

23
00:03:34,350 --> 00:03:36,525
Pip? Can I tell you something?

24
00:03:42,350 --> 00:03:44,744
I was so proud of our windmill.

25
00:03:48,350 --> 00:03:51,213
When it ripped, I got mad. Really mad.

26
00:03:55,350 --> 00:03:58,043
Then I rushed, and I made it worse.

27
00:04:02,350 --> 00:04:03,962
That's a lot of mad.

28
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:10,813
A whole windmill full of mad!

29
00:04:15,350 --> 00:04:17,898
I'm sorry I said you let go.

30
00:04:22,350 --> 00:04:25,177
You didn't. You held on the whole time.

31
00:04:29,350 --> 00:04:31,154
Thank you for telling me.

32
00:04:36,350 --> 00:04:38,988
Want to fix it together? Slowly?

33
00:04:39,338 --> 00:04:40,476
Slowly.

34
00:04:43,350 --> 00:04:45,211
Look! Rainbow paper!

35
00:04:58,350 --> 00:05:00,150
Slow... and gentle.

36
00:05:05,350 --> 00:05:07,304
It looks even better now.

37
00:05:32,350 --> 00:05:33,715
It spins!

38
00:05:34,065 --> 00:05:35,354
We fixed it!

39
00:05:40,350 --> 00:05:42,063
Pip! Your scarf!

40
00:05:47,350 --> 00:05:50,720
When I'm mad, I can stop and tell you.

